# TypeScript and frontend

## Stack

This repo uses Next.js (App Router under `src/app` where applicable), React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Phaser for the game client, and Supabase for backend data when present.

## Conventions

- Match existing import style and component patterns in neighboring files.
- Keep game logic in dedicated modules or Phaser scenes; avoid bloating route handlers or page components.
- Prefer extending existing helpers in `lib/` over duplicating logic.

## API and server code

Route handlers and server-only utilities should stay aligned with existing patterns in `src/app/api` and `lib/` (naming, error responses, typing).
